# Working-area files that are NOT package content.
#
# The working area is a flat mirror of upstream paths, so refresh treats
# anything without an upstream counterpart as a new source file and copies it
# into files/ — which the resolver then shadows into the build tree and
# pkg_build ships inside the distributable. The dev gate script lives here for
# editing convenience, not because it belongs to the firmware. The design docs
# moved to design-docs/forth-core/ (2026-08-02); the doc patterns below stay as
# a defensive fence so a stray doc can never ship.
#
# Ignoring is retroactive: adding a pattern here makes the matching file
# unproducible from the working area, so the next refresh deletes any
# patches//files/ entry previously generated for it. The working copy is never
# touched.
#
# Do NOT ignore *.c / *.h — test_dict_reloc.c in particular IS package content
# (it is the self-test suite, and the build reads only the files/ copy).

# Docs live in design-docs/forth-core/; fence against strays.
*.md

# The gate runner. Invoked from the working area as
# ./packages/forth-core/build-test.sh; the firmware never reads it.
build-test.sh

# The design-audit runner and its baseline moved to design-docs/forth-core/
# (self-contained there since 2026-08-02). Patterns kept as a fence — check G
# is what caught design-audit.sh shipping as package content before this
# entry existed.
design-audit.sh
.design-audit-baseline
